<title>USA: Neurex Corp says names John Varian CFO.</title>
<headline>Neurex Corp says names John Varian CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neurex Corp said Wednesday it appointed John Varian vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Neurex said he replaces Bradford Wait, who plans to retire from the company.</p>
<p>Varian was previously CFO of Anergen Inc, a biotechnology company.</p>
